  m_text: "Your challenge is to brew the strongest restorative mixture.\r\n\r1. Point
    at a potion to inspect its Health and Fill values.\r\n\r2. Pour your chosen potions
    into the cauldron.\r\n\r3. The cauldrons capacity is limited. Each potion can
    only be used once.\r\n\r4. When you are satisfied, touch the floating glowing
    rune next to the cauldron with the wand tip.\r\n\rHold the RESET button to start
    over."
